<item><title>Benin fuel depots blame station queues on distribution delays</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/bj/benin-fuel-depots-blame-station-queues-on-distribution-faa30b/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/bj/benin-fuel-depots-blame-station-queues-on-distribution-faa30b/</guid><category>Benin</category><description>Depot director Sosthène H. Mesmin Hounsou says stocks remain available, while higher demand strains station staff, trucks and delivery schedules.</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 09:01:20 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/bj/benin-fuel-depots-blame-station-queues-on-distribution-faa30b/share.jpg" length="40839" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/bj/benin-fuel-depots-blame-station-queues-on-distribution-faa30b/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Benin presents dual-apprenticeship model at African skills forum</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/bj/benin-presents-dual-apprenticeship-model-at-african-skills-3dc5d6/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/bj/benin-presents-dual-apprenticeship-model-at-african-skills-3dc5d6/</guid><category>Benin</category><description>At a ministerial roundtable in Oran, Awaou Baco described national qualifications and a unified ministry linking training, employment and business.</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 04:04:34 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/bj.jpg" length="29969" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/bj.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
